{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026hIdI31MMYY1795618284.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國新申領和續領失業金人數都減少。</p><p></p><p>美國勞工部公布首次申領失業保險救濟人數，上星期減少1.3萬人，至18.9萬，並少過市場預期的20萬人。持續申領人數按周減少9.5萬人，至169.7萬，並少過市場預期的174萬人。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T15:43:56.312053+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":107,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T14:50:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T08:57:10.832421+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T15:37:17.330722+00:00","content_hash":"8789beaa7a4cf504f51c243ec219ee9c98ef26e4b2b93bbda98f723c0ea2b0ed","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-25T15:43:56.312053+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}